# Naming conventions

| Context | Convention | Example |
| ------- | ---------- | ------- |
| Python modules | `snake_case.py` | `appointment_service.py` |
| SQLAlchemy models | `PascalCase` class | `class Appointment` |
| Pydantic schemas | `PascalCase` + suffix | `PatientCreate`, `PatientRead` |
| React components | `PascalCase.tsx` | `AppointmentCard.tsx` |
| React hooks | `useX.ts` | `useAppointments.ts` |
| TS lib/schemas | `camelCase.ts` | `appointmentSchema.ts` |
| TanStack Router | file-route convention | `dashboard.patients.$patientId.tsx` |

CI enforces via `pnpm run check:filenames`.
